---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Security Policy"
  path="/security"
  description="Security vulnerability disclosure policy, scope, safe harbor, and bounty program for Northlatch Labs LLC."
>
  <section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:28px">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <p class="cmd">Trust &amp; Security</p>
      <h1>Security Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Responsible vulnerability disclosure, authorized testing scope, and safe harbor commitments for Northlatch Labs LLC.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <div class="doc-card">
        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Vulnerability Disclosure</h2>
          <p>Report potential security vulnerabilities directly to <a href="mailto:security@projectxprotocol.dev" class="accent">security@projectxprotocol.dev</a>. All reports are acknowledged within 24 hours.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Authorized Scope</h2>
          <p>All Move packages listed on the <a href="/on-chain" class="accent">On-Chain Proof page</a>, as well as the web front ends served at <code>northlatch.tech</code>, <code>projectxprotocol.dev</code>, and <code>weir.social</code>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Safe Harbor</h2>
          <p>Good-faith security research conducted within the listed scope is authorized. Northlatch Labs LLC will not pursue legal action against researchers acting in good faith.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Bounty Rewards</h2>
          <p>Rewards are evaluated case-by-case based on severity and impact. Critical fund-loss reports have paid up to $50,000.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-meta">Last updated 2026-09-21 &middot; Northlatch Labs LLC</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
